2
00:08:34,285 --> 00:08:40,285
Zombie Apocalypse is a action, horror, science
fiction film directed by Nick Lyon.

3
00:12:51,428 --> 00:12:57,428
Months after a zombie plague has wiped out 90 percent of the American population, a small group of
survivors fight their way cross-country to a rumored refuge on the island of Catalina.

4
00:17:08,571 --> 00:17:14,571
Henry, played by Ving Rhames.

5
00:21:25,714 --> 00:21:31,714
Ramona, played by Taryn Manning.

6
